## Why turn-taking is important

Voxtral Realtime is a 4B-parameter model trained end-to-end for streaming speech recognition, and at a 480&nbsp;ms delay it is competitive with the leading realtime transcription APIs.<Cite id="voxtral-realtime" note="At a 480 ms delay it's on par with Scribe v2 Realtime and Whisper; at 960 ms it matches or beats offline models such as Voxtral Mini Transcribe V2. TEST, a deliberately long note: it is a 4B-parameter model that supports 13 languages, ships under Apache 2.0, and is trained for streaming from the start rather than adapted from an offline model with chunking." />

